        "PolicyName": "customers can read their own favourites",
        "PolicyDescription": "SCHEMA_FIELD vs AUTH rule \u2014 compiled into a read filter, so this is isolation, not a hidden list. A wishlist is a statement about someone's intentions and shouldn't be readable by other customers or by staff without cause.",
